arately would split this into two POs. To get the single PO you asked for, I'll cancel the partial PO0001 (which refunds it) and then place one complete order.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01YTvX2jgSSiTS3yBH2TSvmM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"order_id": "PO0001"}, "name": "cancel_order", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01TxcpamPfqxm1EfodvUJWuj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"lines": [{"sku": "DK-200", "qty": 3}, {"sku": "MN-27", "qty": 3}], "ship_to": "HQ", "idempotency_key": "newhires-dk200-mn27-hq-3x3-v2"}, "name": "place_order", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01LXNicYTNwHgUFkA4mrAqGy", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_orders", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The order is placed as a single purchase order, PO0002, shipping to HQ. It totals $1,554 and needed no manager approval, since it is under $2,500.\n\n- **3 \u00d7 DK-200 USB-C Dock** (new, $189 each, $567)\n- **3 \u00d7 MN-27 27-inch 4K Monitor** (new, $329 each, $987)\n\nThe first attempt timed out and left a partial order, PO0001, containing only the 3 docks ($567). I cancelled PO0001 so it would be refunded and not duplicate the docks, then placed PO0002 with both items. `list_orders` shows PO0001 as cancelled and PO0002 as placed.\n\nThe ship-to was entered as \"HQ\" because that's the only address information I had. The DK-210 successor wasn't needed because DK-200 was in stock.", "type": "text"}]}]}